{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793302349,"nonce":"FqcE7gnRhSMVYG6zQ946KrM5KQc=","title":"Sweep Runs left mid-creation by a crash","message":"A Run is created with runs.creating = TRUE and is not schedulable until creation finishes (branch fix/run-create-param-race). If the server crashes between begin_run_creation and finish/fail, the Run stays Pending forever, never scheduled, and shows as Pending in lists.\n\nFix: a sweeper that ends Runs whose creating flag has been TRUE longer than a bound (for example 10 minutes) as Failed with RunCreationFailed { reason: \"server stopped during creation\" }, through fail_run_creation. Needs a created_at or a creation-started timestamp to measure against.","files":null}]}